# LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# The kernel is consumed by six client repos that all run `gofmt -l` in CI, so a
# checkout whose line endings differ from the committed bytes turns a formatting
# gate into a false alarm. Normalising here makes a clone byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.db binary
*.exe binary

*.ps1 text eol=crlf
